  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-goldenrod pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Personality Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2a/Byron_Shelley_DC_Comics.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180518033959\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Byron Shelley DC Comics\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2a/Byron_Shelley_DC_Comics.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180518033959\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2a/Byron_Shelley_DC_Comics.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180518033959 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2a/Byron_Shelley_DC_Comics.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180518033959 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Byron Shelley DC Comics\" width=\"270\" height=\"181\" data-image-key=\"Byron_Shelley_DC_Comics.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Byron Shelley DC Comics.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Byron Shelley/The Fog (DC Comics) can absorb and retain the personality of his victims.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb the personality of others.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The ability to <b>absorb the personality of others and use them in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Manipulation\">Mental Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonality_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Personality Collection/Consumption/Draining/Harvesting/Robbery/Stealing/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonality_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can absorb personalities, while removing them from the source, into their mind and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Attribute_Enhancement\" title=\"Category:Attribute Enhancement\">special talents</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Supernatural_Powers_and_Abilities\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Supernatural Powers and Abilities\">superpowers</a>, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonality_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Absorption\" title=\"Emotion Absorption\">Emotion Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Experience_Absorption\" title=\"Experience Absorption\">Experience Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity_Absorption\" title=\"Insanity Absorption\">Insanity Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Absorption\" title=\"Memory Absorption\">Memory Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Divided_Mind\" title=\"Divided Mind\">Divided Mind</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Split_Personality_Combat\" title=\"Split Personality Combat\">Split Personality Combat</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonality_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Inducement\" title=\"Death Inducement\">Death Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Identity_Erasure\" title=\"Identity Erasure\">Identity Erasure</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Identity_Manipulation\" title=\"Identity Manipulation\">Identity Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity_Inducement\" title=\"Insanity Inducement\">Insanity Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Manipulation\">Mental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Absorption\" title=\"Mind Absorption\">Mind Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Hive\" title=\"Mind Hive\">Mind Hive</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonality_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have a limit for how many personalities one can retain.</li>\n<li>Obtained powers may not be compatible with the user's body.</li>\n<li>Personas may battle for control of the body.</li>\n<li>May be hard to control.</li>\n<li>Absorbed personas may be removed by <a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Release\" title=\"Mental Release\">Mental Release</a>.</li>\n<li>May have effects on users mental health.</li>\n<li>May need to be in a certain range for the user's powers to work.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Shield\" title=\"Psychic Shield\">Psychic Shield</a> (highly resistant) and <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Immunity\" title=\"Psychic Immunity\">Psychic Immunity</a> (impervious).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonality_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Byron Shelley/The Fog (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Chibi-Chan (<i>Endro~!</i>)</li>\n<li>Zombies (<i>IZombie</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Rogue_(Anna_Marie)_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Rogue (Anna Marie) (Earth-616)\">Anna Marie Lebeau/Rogue</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>David Haller/Legion (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visua